# icons.aipo — Universal Vector Icon System for Zoe UI (`aipo.zoe`)
# Supports Lucide, Heroicons, Phosphor, Tabler, Material Symbols, and Devicons.
# Rasterized on-demand via tiny-skia and hardware-cached in GPU textures.

